#: src/app/[lang]/features/ai-auto-categorization/page.tsx:164
msgid "On first run, Budgie downloads Qwen3 1.7B Q4 and a 768-dim Nomic embedding model from the Hugging Face hub. Both are stored in your app sandbox. For each new transaction, the embedding model runs first — if a strong nearest neighbor exists in your history, the result is instant. If not, Qwen3 1.7B generates a suggestion. Your response (accept, edit, or reject) feeds back into the embedding index without any network call."
