msgstr "Las transacciones de la categoría de origen se reasignan a la categoría de destino, y la categoría vacía se elimina. Reversible antes de confirmar."

#: src/feature/component/pillar-hub-page-shell/pillar-hub-page-shell.tsx:94
msgid "The MIT License means you can fork Budgie, modify it, and run your own build. Your financial data belongs to you — not to a vendor who can change terms, raise prices, or shut down. If Budgie ever stops meeting your needs, you take your data and your build with you."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/budgie-offline-financial-data/page.tsx:568
msgid "The most private way to get bank data into Budgie is manual import. Most banks allow you to download transaction history in standard formats like CSV, OFX, or QIF. You download this file directly from your bank, and Budgie imports it locally on your device."
msgstr "La forma mas privada de incorporar datos bancarios en Budgie es la importacion manual. La mayoria de los bancos permiten descargar el historial de transacciones en formatos estandar como CSV, OFX o QIF. Descargas este archivo directamente de tu banco, y Budgie lo importa localmente en tu dispositivo."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/dark-mode/page.tsx:159
#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:1467
msgid "The native splash screen reads the OS theme directly so the transition into the React Native app stays in dark mode without an intermediate light state."
msgstr "La pantalla de inicio nativa lee el tema del sistema operativo directamente para que la transición a la app React Native permanezca en modo oscuro sin destello."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/open-source-budgeting-transparency/page.tsx:338
msgid "The open-source security community includes:"
msgstr "La comunidad de seguridad de código abierto incluye:"

#: src/app/[lang]/not-found.tsx:28
msgid "The page you are looking for does not exist or has been moved."
msgstr "La página que buscas no existe o ha sido movida."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/erste-bank-pdf-import/page.tsx:101
msgid "The parser extracts account holder, IBAN, opening/closing balances, and every transaction line including value date, booking date, and reference text. MCC is inferred from booking-text patterns where present."
msgstr "El analizador extrae titular, IBAN, saldos de apertura/cierre y cada línea de transacción, incluida la fecha valor, la fecha de apunte y el importe."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/budgie-offline-financial-data/page.tsx:595
msgid "The parsing and categorization happen entirely on your device. Budgie includes pattern recognition for common transaction formats from major banks, and you can customize categorization rules that apply locally."
msgstr "El analisis y la categorizacion ocurren completamente en tu dispositivo. Budgie incluye reconocimiento de patrones para formatos de transacciones comunes de los principales bancos, y puedes personalizar las reglas de categorizacion que se aplican localmente."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/privatbank-import/page.tsx:171
#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:697
msgid "The parsing step is on-device. You only need internet to download the XLSX from PrivatBank24 in the first place."
msgstr "El paso de análisis es en el dispositivo. Solo necesitas internet para descargar el XLSX de PrivatBank24 en primer lugar."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/local-first-movement-developers/page.tsx:1066
msgid "The pendulum is swinging back from maximum centralization toward a more balanced architecture where local and cloud computing each handle what they do best."
msgstr "El péndulo oscila de vuelta desde la centralización máxima hacia una arquitectura más equilibrada donde la computación local y en la nube gestionan cada una lo que mejor saben hacer."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/cloud-budgeting-privacy-risks/page.tsx:175
msgid "The personal finance app market has exploded. Mint, YNAB, Copilot, Monarch Money, Lunch Money, and dozens of others promise to help you manage your money. Most offer free tiers or low monthly subscriptions that seem reasonable for the value provided."
msgstr "El mercado de aplicaciones de finanzas personales ha explotado. Mint, YNAB, Copilot, Monarch Money, Lunch Money y decenas de otras prometen ayudarte a gestionar tu dinero. La mayoria ofrece niveles gratuitos o suscripciones mensuales bajas que parecen razonables por el valor proporcionado."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/date-filter-presets/page.tsx:101
msgid "The picker is locale-aware. Week-start day comes from your device locale. Last Week always means \"the most recent completed Monday-to-Sunday\" (or Sunday-to-Saturday for en-US users)."
msgstr "El selector respeta la configuración regional. El día de inicio de semana viene de la configuración regional del dispositivo. Última semana siempre significa «la semana completa más reciente»."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/biometric-authentication/page.tsx:155
#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:767
msgid "The PIN entry screen appears as a fallback. After five biometric failures, the OS itself prompts the device passcode."
msgstr "La pantalla de entrada de PIN aparece como alternativa. Después de cinco fallos biométricos, el propio sistema operativo solicita el código del dispositivo."

#: src/app/[lang]/features/pin-app-lock/page.tsx:147
#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:724
msgid "The PIN is the encryption key — there's no recovery mechanism, by design. Keep your PIN somewhere safe (a password manager works) or use the database backup feature to restore from a known-good state."
msgstr "El PIN es la clave de cifrado: no hay mecanismo de recuperación, por diseño. Guarda tu PIN en un lugar seguro (un gestor de contraseñas sirve)."

#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:708
msgid "The PIN unlocks the app and unlocks SQLCipher — no PIN, no readable database."
msgstr "El PIN desbloquea la app y desbloquea SQLCipher: sin PIN, la base de datos no es legible."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/cloud-budgeting-privacy-risks/page.tsx:637
msgid "The Plaid Problem: Third-Party Data Aggregation Risks"
msgstr "El problema de Plaid: riesgos de la agregacion de datos por terceros"

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/ynab-alternatives-privacy/page.tsx:190
msgid "The Price Increases"
msgstr "Los aumentos de precio"

#: src/app/[lang]/features/ai-tag-suggestions/page.tsx:117
msgid "The primary engine is the on-device Qwen3 1.7B language model. It ranks tag candidates from your existing tag vocabulary by semantic similarity to the transaction context — matching phrasing variations that a simple text lookup would miss. When the LLM is still loading or busy with another inference, the embedding fallback takes over: a nearest-neighbor lookup over 768-dimensional embeddings of your past tagged transactions, running in milliseconds without waiting for the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/[lang]/features/transaction-tags/page.tsx:167
#: src/feature/constant/feature-registry.constant.ts:537
msgid "The primary tag shows as a corner-star badge on the transaction list so you can scan a long list for #vacation or #shared without opening rows. Long-press to rotate which tag is primary."
msgstr "La etiqueta principal aparece como distintivo de estrella en la esquina de la lista de transacciones para que puedas escanear una lista larga buscando #vacaciones o #compartido."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/open-source-budgeting-transparency/page.tsx:873
msgid "The principle of minimal data collection guides all decisions"
msgstr "El principio de recopilación mínima de datos guía todas las decisiones"

#: src/generic/component/testimonials-section/testimonials-slider.tsx:49
